<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113923" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χηρᾰμός</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hole, cleft, hollow,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοίλην εἰσέπτατο πέτρην,
			χηραμόν,</span> of a rock pigeon, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.495
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				614b35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				8.16
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. [σφηκῶν</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				181
			</span></i>; of a mouse's <i>hole,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Babr.
				107.13
			</span></i>; of a <i>hollow</i> in the hilt of a sword, <i><span class="en">
				Ach.Tat.
				3.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				21
			</span></i>; of a shell, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.11
			</span></i>; of the <i>hollows</i> on the sides of the tongue, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.107
			</span></i>.—The gend. is undetermined in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>; fem., <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1452
			</span></i>, prob. in Arist.l.c.; masc., <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				3.26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				2.14
			</span></i>: heterocl. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χηραμά, τά,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				55
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				149
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				9.382
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χηλαμός, χαραμός,
			χειραμός.</span></div>
